text = "You managed to repair the van and escape - or did you? 

Once the Entity has selected its victim, it does not stop until it brings their target into the forest's embrace.

Two days after coming home, you disappeared. The company reported you missing after two weeks. You were quickly forgotten. 

You are now one with the forest. "
horizontal_alignment = 1

[node name="GoodEndingLabel" type="Label" parent="EndingScreen" unique_id=95113918]
