offset_bottom = 11.5
grow_horizontal = 2
grow_vertical = 2
text = "After banishing the Entity and repairing the van, you escaped back home. 

Your boss has asked you to come in for an urgent debriefing - they want to know about what you saw. A promotion with a significant pay raise was mentioned, among other things such as an NDA. 

There will be more work for you in the future. "
